tests/generate-ac3-tables.py fetches the pinned files, checks their hashes
and converts the ATSC A/52 hearing threshold, log-addition, band, bap, frame
size and bit allocation parameter values from codec-ac3's representation back
to the standard's, writing them to src/ac3_tables.inc. The AC-3 decoder in
src/ac3.s is handwritten x86-64 assembly; no codec-ac3 code is included in or
linked into either player. Its dither generator reproduces the sequence of
FFmpeg's lagged Fibonacci generator (libavutil lfg.c, seed 0) so decodes
compare closely; no FFmpeg code is included.

